### =========================================================
### NEW GAP API 5
### ADMIN - ALL USERS
### =========================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?search=test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Students only
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=student
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Instructors only
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=instructor
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Active users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Pending instructors/users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Multiple filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=instructor&status=pending&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


